             previous 1.5.0 pin ran the archunit-junit5 ENGINE 1.5.0 against
             the BOM-transitive archunit CORE 1.4.2 — an unsupported mix
             (junit5 1.5.0 expects core 1.5.0 APIs) that nobody could notice
             precisely because the JDK guard silently skips the whole surface
             on newer runtimes. One version everywhere: the framework's own
             pairing. Bump BOTH together (core via this property is not
