                 marketplace-ai capability module (ChatModel/ChatClient plus the
                 spring.ai.model.chat provider selector).
                 Compatibility evidence (docs.spring.io/spring-ai, v2.0.1):
                 "Spring AI 2.0.x supports Spring Boot 4.0.x and 4.1.x."
                 (reference/getting-started.html); releases publish to Maven
                 Central with no extra repository
                 (reference/getting-started.html#artifact-repositories); the
                 coordinates below are the documented
                 reference/getting-started.html#dependency-management recipe
                 (org.springframework.ai:spring-ai-bom, type pom, scope import).
                 Live proof on this project's account: gemini-3.5-flash-lite
                 answers 200 (measured 2026-09-17).
                 Owner: platform maintainers (version-policy §8).
                 Follow-up review: 2026-12-17 (quarterly minor cadence,
